     "Upon inspection of the structures we notice, that we encountered a problem here: When loading ligands from a PDB file, RDKit does not assign bonds in structures like aromatic rings correctly. We use the RDKit function `AssignBondOrdersFromTemplate`, which assigns bonds to a molecule based on a reference molecule, e.g. in our case based on the SMILES pattern of the molecule. \n",
     "\n",
-    "Check for further information: [RDKit discussion on *Aromaticity of non-protein molecules in PDB not detected*](https://github.com/rdkit/rdkit/issues/1031) and [RDKit documentation on `AssignBondOrdersFromTemplate`](http://rdkit.org/docs/source/rdkit.Chem.AllChem.html#AssignBondOrdersFromTemplate)."
